<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<section class="wrap medium page-pad prose">
  <p class="eyebrow">The fine print</p>
  <h1 class="display">Terms of use</h1>
  <%- include('_draft') %>
  <h2>Who can join</h2>
  <p>You must be at least <%= config.minAge %> years old and give a real email address. One account per person; institutions may have one shared account.</p>
  <h2>Your work stays yours</h2>
  <p>You keep all rights to your films, photos and writing. By posting, you let FilmHouse display them on the site so other members can see them. You can remove them at any time.</p>
  <h2>Only post what you're entitled to</h2>
  <p>Only add films you worked on or have permission to share, and only credit people truthfully. If someone has posted your work without permission, contact us and we'll take it down.</p>
  <h2>Gigs and crew calls</h2>
  <p>FilmHouse doesn't check bulletins, pay, or employ anyone. Agreements are between members. Meet in safe places, get terms in writing, and never send money or ID documents to someone you met here. Report anything suspicious.</p>
  <h2>Behaviour</h2>
  <p>Follow the <a href="/guidelines">community guidelines</a>. We may hide content or suspend accounts that break them.</p>
  <h2>No guarantees</h2>
  <p>FilmHouse is provided as it is, and may change or have downtime. We're not liable for agreements made between members.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><em>[contact email — to be added]</em></p>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
